efined planting concentrated in front of the formal rooms and the ground growing slightly simpler toward the far corners. The whole composition is naturalistic and asymmetric in arrangement but kept finely maintained. Downstream object placement has latitude over the exact pond outline and size, the form of the arched crossing and water feature, the routing of the stepping-stone path, and the precise placement and number of lanterns, shrubs, and trees, keeping the pond-and-water composition central in front of the reception room, the path linking it to the engawa step, and the framing trees toward the perimeter.

